    {
      "entryId": "ezr-1-2",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "Cyrus's own confession of the charge. First principle: the God of heaven steers the greatest empire's decree — Isaiah had named Cyrus generations earlier.",
